; merlin.def - module-definition file for the Merlin agent DLL.
;
; Lists the functions the DLL exports. Passing this file to the final
; `gcc -shared` link turns OFF mingw's default --export-all-symbols behavior
; and exports ONLY the symbols named below.
;
; This is required for the windows/386 build: under Go 1.27 the c-archive
; carries standard-library symbols that i686-w64-mingw32-ld refuses to
; auto-export ("cannot export addMulVVWx / go:buildinfo: symbol not found"),
; which breaks `make 386`. Exporting an explicit list sidesteps that and, as a
; bonus, keeps the export table down to the real entry points on both
; architectures instead of thousands of internal Go symbols.
;
; The names are the //export functions in main.go plus Magic() from merlin.c.
EXPORTS
    Run
    VoidFunc
    DllInstall
    DllRegisterServer
    DllUnregisterServer
    Merlin
    Magic
